{
 "about": "Held-out bilingual benchmark for Ask AI (E11). Every case asks about the demo dataset named below. Expected numbers are computed from the data at run time through the widget-data path (the `from` and `difference` specs), never written here, so the benchmark stays right when the data changes. Run with backend/scripts/bench_ask.py; see docs/ASK_BENCHMARK.md for the targets.",
 "dataset": "Demo — Sales",
 "version": 1,
